window.products.push({"id":797037,"name":"Big Comfy Bean Bag Chair: Posh Large Beanbag Chairs with Removable Cover for Kids, Teens and Adults - Polyester Cloth Puff Sack Lounger Furniture for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e2IbTkECL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM BEANBAGS WITH REMOVABLE COVERS:  Most competing bean bags don't offer removable covers to cut costs. We believe its important to have a removable cover to allow you to wash the cover and to also switch up styles/colors when you want. Posh bean bags are the perfect, comfortable addition to any space. With a removable cover made of 100% PVC polyester fabric and stuffed with the highest quality virgin polystyrene beans, our bag is durable and designed to last.  IDEAL SIZE  Measuring 27 inches (W) x 27 inches (D) x 22 inches (H), our bean bags are the perfect size for everyone, from toddlers and children to teens and adults. The whole family will love relaxing in our pouf chairs!  FUN FURNITURE  Posh bean bag chairs are a great addition to any room in your home or even your office. Put one in your game or movie room, one in the playroom, one in your child's bedroom or teen's dorm room and even one in your hip office space!  COZY SPOT  Our cozy bean bag sacks offer ultimate comfort and are perfect for a variety of different activities. If your bean bag gets dirty, remove the cover and throw it in the wash! From reading to gaming, drawing, studying or working, girls and boys of all ages will be fighting over who gets to relax in the Posh bean bag chair, so you might want to grab more than one!  STYLISH PATTERNS  Designed for all ages, from children to adults, choose from 20 different colors or patterns so everyone in the family or office can have their own and it can perfectly match any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e2IbTkECL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Posh Creations","source_asin":"B01MDOO0I9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MDOO0I9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MDOO0I9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
