window.products.push({"id":797098,"name":"kidstinct Wine Travel Bags for Airplane (4 Set), Reusable Wine Bags for Travel, Wine Bottle Protector, Protection for Luggage, Safety Impact Resistant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xz0XIc3RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you planning your next amazing trip and thinking to bring some bottles along? It would be great to take back home some delicious flavors of a distant place, perhaps as a gift for a loved one or to enjoy for yourself while thinking back to the beautiful landscapes you've seen. But to travel with bottles in your suitcase is risky, what if they break during your trip and spill liquid all over your clothes? Our Smooth Nomad wine bottle protectors will solve that problem and let you travel with peace of mind! Make sure to carry one or the other wine travel bag along with you, they pack flat in your luggage and don't use too much space. There are four layers of protective bubble wrap on the inside, that can be used to protect precious items, like jewelry or fragile gadgets from being scratched. The outside is made of a strong PVC protective layer to protect the bag from puncture even if the glass on the inside should break. The liquids are further protected from spilling thanks to the double ziplock that seals the holder.The ziplock is then folded a few times to be closed once again by a Velcro line. What makes this product stand out from its competitors is the design, that is different on every wine sleeve and gives the set a special modern character. This wine travel protector set can be a great gift to bring to a party or for a dinner invitation! Our wine bottle bubble bag protector is: ✅ RESEALABLE - can be used many times ✅ INSULATED - it can be used to keep bottles chill ✅ SMOOTH - The material feels nice to the touch and comes with cool designs ✅ LEAKPROOF - 6 layers of protection ✅ Made by a family of travel enthusiasts Carry bottles in your checked. Add Smooth Nomad's padded wine travel bags to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xz0XIc3RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kidstinct","source_asin":"B08FLWSYB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FLWSYB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FLWSYB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
