window.products.push({"id":797124,"name":"Shopkins Pillow Season 1 2 3 4 5: Kooky Cookie, Cheeky Chocolate, Chee Zee, Apple Blossom (12 x 12) (BestKins)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NRlztQpBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Instantly update the look and feel of any child's bed, couch or room with fun, colorful pillowcases with their favorite Shopkins characters. Featuring: Strawberry Kiss, Mini Muffin, D'lish Donut, Lippy Lips, Cupcake Chic, Kooky Cookie, Cheeky Chocolate, Chee Zee, Apple Blossom Cookie and more! Get comfy with your very own Shopkins throw pillow. Incredible quality and graphics. Super soft, spun from 100% polyester, cuddly and perfect for comfy sleeping. Each Shopkins throw pillow measures 12 inch x 12 inch and is the perfect additional to any kid's bed. Take pillows with you to make traveling fun and feel like their bed at home. Perfect for getting cozy with on your bed, couch, or any lounging area. Fun pillowcases also make great gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NRlztQpBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shopkins","source_asin":"B01HSG8CBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HSG8CBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HSG8CBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":797125,"name":"Dish Drying Mats for Kitchen Counter, 12’’ x 8’’ Rack Tableware Mat Quick Drying Absorbent Pad Drainer Mat Dish Drying Pad Water Diatomite Absorbent P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZZvn-VQZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Super Absorbent】2pcak dish mats sizes: 11.8 1'' x 7.87 '' & 8.66''x2.67''.Dish drying mat is made of absorbent diatomite that can quickly absorb a large amount of water droplets. Catches drips under a dish rack or place pots, pans, serveware and glassware directly on the rack tableware mat and can keep the kitchen and bathroom countertops dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZZvn-VQZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bumlon","source_asin":"B09NPH96JB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NPH96JB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NPH96JB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":797126,"name":"Stemmed Snake Wine Glasses Set of 2 by The Wine Savant - Snake Stemmed Glasses 8\" H, Goth Gifts, Snake Gifts, Snake Decor, Spooky Cocktails, Wine Glas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PGcA-kjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's a ghoulishly good time always with our Stemmed Snake Wine glasses! A must-have for Halloween or any time of the year you want to celebrate the macabre. Be a little more frightening at your next dinner party! This spooky Wine glass set is a great gift for any cocktail lover! Perfect for Halloween and beyond, the design of this two-piece set recalls a vintage ossuary. Scare the heck out of your guests while they enjoy their favorite wine. Terrify and delight your guests when you dress up your next party with the Set of 2 Stemmed Snake Wine Glasses that each holds 12 oz of your favorite wine. Your drinks will be even more delicious in these spooky glasses. A snake body is depicted in an elegant form holding up the glass that encapsulates your favorite wine in a silver finish. These glasses are designed to spook your guests, your visitors, and yourself when you look at them. An eerie and elegant addition to any occasion. Don't get too excited, our snake glasses won't scare you away completely. Made of durable borosilicate glass, the snake body stemmed wine glass pair is a great conversation piece and will give your Halloween table setting an interesting look. Each glass holds up to 12 ounces and measures approximately 8” in height. Dishwasher safe and lead-free so they are super easy to keep clean. Make sure your Halloween themed party isn't missing the perfect glasses! These two beautifully detailed snake bodies emerge from below the glass surface and offer an eerie contrast. Raise a glass to Halloween! Stemming from a deep bone-chilling passion for wine and all things creepy, this is an ideal gift for Halloween or wine enthusiasts and makes a great impression during holiday parties. A fun glass that is complemented with a classy, molded snake body design. Our stemmed wine glasses are reminiscent of a spooky feel. The Wine Savant is taking the art of wine to an all-new level, with this unique line of snake body glasses that are adorned with jewel-like snake heads. Make a statement when entertaining friends and family or just drinking by yourself. These glasses are made out of high-quality borosilicate glass. The Wine Savant's design may be haunting and spooky, but your wine will taste even better in this sleek glass set and you'll make a statement with every pour.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PGcA-kjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Wine Savant","source_asin":"B0B112RW3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B112RW3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B112RW3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
