window.products.push({"id":797188,"name":"2 Pack Cow Chocolate Molds, Dairy Cattle Cake Pan Silicone Candy Fondant Biscuit Cookie Baking Mold Soap Lotion Bars Polymer Clay Mold (Random Color)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hpy948BtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Dimension: each cavity can hold about 1.4oz, each cavity size: L6.9cm x W7cm x H1.1cm Material: U.S.food-grade silicone.Temperature Safe from -40 to +440F (-40 to +230 degrees Celsius) Very easy to use and clean up chocolates come out perfect every time. It can be used both in baking and freezing. Color: ITEM COLR RANDOMLY SENT(possibly not the same color as pictures),","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hpy948BtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hi-Party","source_asin":"B07TF9GSQP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TF9GSQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TF9GSQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":797189,"name":"KitchenAid Triple Riveted Stamped Steak Knives (Set of 6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ljClVKh+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The KitchenAid Triple Riveted Stamped Steak Knives Set are ideal for everyday meals and special dining occasions. This steak knife set includes 6 steak knives. The hand wash only knife's high carbon stainless steel blade is fixed to the polypropylene handle with a stamped triple rivet for strength and reliability. These steak knives have a sharp points and deep fine edge blades that curve upwards towards the tip to provide a smooth cut through steak, roasts and chops. The high carbon steel blades hold an edge longer than conventional stainless steel blades and are easy to sharpen. The contoured handles and blades are balanced for perfect control.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ljClVKh+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B003DTL7X4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003DTL7X4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003DTL7X4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":797190,"name":"Modus Furniture Cally Solid Wood Nightstand, Antique Mocha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lLd74JfXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Cally Solid Wood Nightstand is crafted entirely from solid pine for the classic farmhouse look. Sanded and stained solid wood drawer boxes feature English dovetail joinery for maximum rigidity and lasting quality. Dust cover adds protection under the bottom drawer. Full extension, ball bearing drawer slides for smooth, efficient operation. Trimmed with heavy round knobs in a distressed bronze finish. Frame-and-panel construction, dowel and tongue-and-groove joinery ensure structural integrity. Wood is kiln dried for added strength. Please keep in mind that natural wood must breathe and is affected by environmental conditions. Expect to see shrinkage or expansion and plank movement over time. These normal occurrences will not affect the structural integrity of the piece. With proper care, this solid wood furniture will last for generations. Frame, top, side, front and drawer boxes are solid pine; drawer bottoms are hardwood plywood; back panel and dust covers are hardwood plywood. Covered by a 1-year manufacturer's warranty. Product Dimensions: 18-Inch by 27-Inch by 29-Inch. Weighs 70-pounds. With graceful curves, modern sensibility and functional appeal, the Cally bedroom provides an updated take on classic farmhouse style. Crafted entirely from solid pine, rough-hewn planks bear the characteristic saw marks, dents, pits and random knots of freshly-milled timber. Antique Mocha finish uses a rustic glaze to simulate the patina of weathered lumber and a lacquer top coat to showcase the rich natural character of the wood. The Cally collection offers a classic form-meets-function silhouette that harkens back to simpler times. An obvious fit for any country or lodge setting, Cally should also be considered as part of Southwest, or Mediterranean décors, where its oil rubbed bronze knobs and warmth of character complement bold vibrant colors and rigid materials like stucco, tile and stone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lLd74JfXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B00LJV9NYI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LJV9NYI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LJV9NYI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
