window.products.push({"id":797226,"name":"Wine Aerator,Topwine One-Touch Electric Wine Decanters,Wine Accessories Air Aerator,Pump Dispenser Kit,Metal Pourer Spout,Enhance Wine Flavor of all A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bxLoc8ExL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Why We Aerate Wine You know when you open a new bottle of wine, taste it, and are hit with that bitter, astringent taste, drying out your mouth? That’s caused by the tannins in your wine that occur naturally in the skin and stems of the grapes.  Age can help soften tannins, and so can aeration—especially in younger wines where the tannic effect may overwhelm the other flavors and aromas in your wine. Wine Varietals that Work Well with Topwine Aglianico, Bordeaux blends, Cabernet Sauvignon, Cabernet Franc, Mourvédre, Nebbiolo, Nero D’Avola, Petit Verdot, Petite Sirah, Syrah, Tannat, Tempranillo, Touriga Nacional, some Malbec, some Pinot Noir. How to install 1) Turn the 'open' side and pull out. 2) Install 4 rechargeable AAA batteries. 3) Screw back to the original place. 4) The guide tube connects the wine aerator. 5) Screw back to the original place. 6) The guide tube connects the wine aerator. Specifications: Dimensions: 5.25×2×3.7 inches (13.3×5.0×9.4 cm) Power Source: 4×AAA Barreries (not included) Weight: 0.5 lbs (160g) Pump Flow: 60.9-67.6 oz/min (1.8-2.0 L/min) Pressure: 100 Kpa (14.5 psi) Volume: 1.2 oz/2 sec What's in the Box 1 x Electric Wine Aerator 1 x User manual 2 x Flexible tubes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bxLoc8ExL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topwine","source_asin":"B0794Y7FP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0794Y7FP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0794Y7FP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
