window.products.push({"id":797243,"name":"Great Sale on Amazon King Size { 1-PC } Fitted/Bottom Sheet Heavy 1500-TC Soft Egyptian Cotton King Size (76x80) Fits 19-22 Inches Fully Elastic Deep ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sovr1fXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Satisfaction Guarantee LUXURY AND COMFORT: Experience the grandeur of 5 Star indulgence when you sleep in these super soft Heavy Egyptian Cotton Sheets. This exquisite Sheet Set has been painstakingly crafted from the finest 100% Long Staple Heavy Cotton yarns keeping your comfort in mind. CLASSIC TAILORED LOOK WITH DEEP POCKETS:  AFFORDABLE LUXURY: Create a welcoming environment and a restful feeling in the bedroom with this TOP QUALITY and AFFORDABLE Bedding Collection. OUR MISSION: We at Decent Sheets are on a mission to become the most customer centric seller on Amazon and are constantly working hard towards achieving the same.  Home Washable Wash them on the Normal cycle and remove sheets from the dryer quickly to keep them wrinkle-free. Keep hues bright and avoid using chlorine or color-safe bleach on colored sheets. Iron your pillow cases for that brand-new feel. Wash linens separately from items with zippers to keep them from pilling. Add detergent to the water instead of pouring it right onto your sheets. Material- Heavy Egyptian Cotton We use High strength durable stitching threads, Premium quality long lasting Elastic on fitted sheets and Leave Optimum Pocket depth to fit standard and deep mattresses. Every yard of fabric we use is inspected at every stage and each sheet set is again individually inspected before being packed and shipped from the factory. By offering impeccable Quality Controls and Versatility, Sheets will enable you to elevate your sleep experience from ordinary to Extra-Ordinary. Each of our piece is individually Inspected before being packed and shipped.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sovr1fXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decent Collection","source_asin":"B08389ZY8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08389ZY8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08389ZY8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
