window.products.push({"id":797276,"name":"gesPINK Condiment Server with Small Lids, Bar Condiment Tray with Lid, Garnish Tray Bar Fruit Caddy with Lid, Chilled Condiment Server for Parties, Pl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DD2yZA3GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎉Cool & Spacious: This condiment tray with ice chamber keeps vegetables, fruits, chocolate, sauces, dips, and other food properly chilled. Fill each of the 5 compartments up with 1.5 cups of delicious snacks, put them onto your buffet table, and delight your much-valued party guests. 🎉Safe & Sturdy: Party serving trays and platters should be made out of thick, stable, and safe materials to be of use for a long time. Et voilà, this garnish tray consists of food-grade, BPA-free, and sturdy PS-plastic, which is even strong enough for a party that gets a little out of control. 🎉Neat & Clean: We especially made this condiment tray dishwasher-safe, so you don’t have to worry about the aftermath of your party. Simply detach the small compartments and put them onto the top layer of your dishwasher. Of course, cleaning the entire tray by hand is also an option. 🎉Open & Close: Close the big lid of this organizer to keep away bugs during a picnic or BBQ. Take out the single condiment containers with lids separately and store them on top of or next to each other inside your fridge. Like that, you can save a lot of space and keep leftovers fresh at the same time. 🎉Versatile & Practical: This condiment caddy with ice tray is the chameleon of countertop organizers. Not only can it be used as a hot dog or pizza topping station, but it also cuts quite a figure as a bar garnish caddy, vegetable and fruit tray, party serving platter, taco bar serving set, or wedding buffet supply. On top of that, it comes with 3 spoons, 3 tongs, and 1 scoop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DD2yZA3GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GESPINK","source_asin":"B0BGP4GS6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGP4GS6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGP4GS6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
