window.products.push({"id":797280,"name":"lunaglow Nano 3-in-1 Vacuum Cleaner - Wet Dry Vacuum - Cordless Mop Vacuum Combo for Tile and Hardwood - Vacuum Cleaner Carpet and Floor - Self-Cleani","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Cr7u4vLOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cordless Vacuum Cleaner with Multi-Skills for Multi-Messes: Forget about getting a broom, a hard floor vacuum, and mops for floor cleaning, because the revolutionary Nano 3-in-1 can do their jobs--all at once, that is! Whether it's dust, pet dander, food & beverage spills, or mud you're dealing with, our upright cordless wet dry vacuum helps cut your cleaning time in half. With just one hand, see your floors squeaky clean with our genius wet dry vacuum mop all in one. Genius Floor Cleaner for Your Multi-Surface Home: Featuring a powerful suction that sucks up debris and a self-propelled multi-function brush roll, the Nano 3-in-1 mops and cleans your floors at the same time so it takes only a single pass. Let our dry & wet vacuum replace your hardwood floor cleaner, wood floor mop, tile floor cleaner and carpet vacuum so you could clean your living room, bedroom, kitchen and even your bathroom using just one device. Electric Mop with Self-Cleaning Roller Brush: The Lunaglow Nano 3-in-1 is meant not just to ease up on house keeping but also to help you rethink how floor cleaning should be. Regardless of the situation, we don't want your hands to get dirty. That's why our amazing wet dry vac is designed with a self-cleaning feature--equipped with 2 separate tanks for clean and dirty water. Never have to worry about the dreadful washing of wet mops for floor cleaning ever again Your Next-Generation Smart Vacuum Mop Floor Cleaner Machine: More than a convenient vacuum and mop in one, the Nano 3-in-1 has everything you're looking for in a hard floor cleaner and more. This rechargeable cordless vacuum cleaner has a long-lasting, quick-charging battery that allows you to clean several areas of your home without dealing with long, pesky cords. Our dry & wet vac even has a backlit water tank, a crystal LED display, and voice prompts. Next-Level Cleaning Technology So You Can Spend More Time Living: Lunaglow is a brand that's dedicated to making the world a better place by providing awesome cleaning technology. Whether you get satisfaction from sucking up dust bunnies or simply clean because you have to, we hope that our Nano 3-in-1 Mop Vacuum Combo makes it way easier for you to clean your home. If not, please let us know right away, and we'll do our best to make it better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Cr7u4vLOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lunaglow","source_asin":"B09HGH7Y58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HGH7Y58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HGH7Y58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
