window.products.push({"id":797352,"name":"4TH Emotion Fall Halloween Pumpkin Pillow Covers 18x18 Inches Set of 4 Trick or Treat Farmhouse Decor Home Throw Cushion Case for Sofa Couch Decoratio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Xxld2yGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polyester PACKAGE INCLUDES: Set of 4 Fall halloween pumpkin pillow covers, No Insert or Filler.Pattern is only on the front and no printing on the back. (4TH Emotion pillow cover can help you to change fall halloween decorations quickly. also a super cute gift for your family and friends.) SIZE & MATERIAL: This pillow cover fits 18x18 inch insert, PLEASE NOTE: All of our pillow covers are made to ensure a snug fit. Each listing size refers to the pillow insert size and not the pillow cover size. To ensure the proper fit, we make all pillow covers slightly smaller (approximately 0.5\" smaller) than the insert size. Made of 100% Polyester linen, soft and skin-friendly, no fading or abrasion, can be used outdoors. EASY TO PUT ON: Color-coordinated hidden zipper closure brings an elegant appearance, and it’s super easy to stuff pillows/fillers into this pillow covers. WASHING TIPS: Machine wash in cold water separately, gently cycle only, dot not bleach. MATERIAL: Made of 100% Polyester linen, soft and skin-friendly, no fading or abrasion, can be used outdoors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Xxld2yGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"4TH Emotion","source_asin":"B09724D46L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09724D46L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09724D46L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":797353,"name":"Vintage Billiards Patent Prints, 6 (8x10) Unframed Photos, Wall Art Decor Gifts Under 20 for Home Office Game Room Studio Gym Man Cave Student Teacher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TENXSUS7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAN CAVE DECOR - Unframed Vintage Patent Art Billiards Prints Set will add a touch of class to any man cave, game room, pool hall, bar, etc. Whether your man is a pool shark, or just enjoys a relaxing game of snooker over a beer, this is a home decor gift he is sure to appreciate. ORIGINAL ARTWORK - Designed by our award winning artist, these 8”x10” pub game pictures are printed on vintage themed paper, giving them a timeless look. They’re the perfect artwork for your any billiards enthusiast or any room or business where pool players congregate. CUSTOMIZE TO YOUR DECOR - This 6 piece art set is unframed, giving you the opportunity to customize it to your man’s liking with his choice of frame. Included are drawings of the original historical patents for the billiard ball, cue, table, pool ball frame, and bridge, making this men’s decor picture set a true conversation starter. DESIGNED AND PRINTED IN USA - Each picture is 8”x10” and printed on high quality FujiColor Crystal Archive Lustre Paper, giving them just a hint of gloss for a timeless look. Unframed prints give you the versatility to hang them on the wall as posters or customize them with frames and matting of your choice. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - We are so sure you will love the quality and beauty of our patent prints that we offer a 100% Satisfaction Guarantee for a full 30 days. This is one gift you will be proud to give to your father, brother, husband or any other special man on your shopping list. So don’t hesitate - order a few sets of our Billiards Patent Prints today and start redecorating your rec room this weekend!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TENXSUS7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STARS BY NATURE","source_asin":"B07J336RTT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J336RTT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J336RTT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
