window.products.push({"id":797359,"name":"FIHAP Collapsible Storage Bins with Lids Closet Organizer Sturdy Fabric Containers Cubes Stackable Box for Clothes Bedroom Blankets Toys, 3 Pack Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KFl+kwK7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quality Polyester Fabric and PP Board [High Quality ] The FIHAP Organization and Storage is made of eco-friendly cotton linen fabric and thick PP plastic board , Durable and sturdy premium fabric ensures the storage containers are strong and long-lasting, no more odor, you can clean this stackable storage bins with lids in water and they won't deform. [Easy to assemble] FIHAP's Collapsible design allows the clothes organizer with lids to be folded flat for saving space when not in use , Featuring 2 handles, the decorative storage baskets are easy to pull or lift, wonderful for organizing wire storage shelves, walk-in closet, bookshelf, under bed storage, bedroom bin, etc. [Multiple Use Occasions] This Lidded Closet Cube is perfect for clothes, toys, comforters, blankets, pillows, socks, bed sheets and quilt cover, books and magazines organizer, towel, or other small personal items for home office desk, nursery bin or socks bin, and you can put lidded cloth bin under bed or above the shelves, also can use these basket cubes in your living room, bedroom, college dorm room, home office etc. [Large Capacity Bin] The closet organizers measure, and come in a set of 3, large capacity to keep items tidy and organized. 18.9\" x 11.4\" x 8.7\" (48 x 29 x 22 cm). you can use the cute grey big bin for clothes, toys, magazines,books and anything else, it is very convenient and practical. [Stackable and Foldable Storage Box] These decorative storage boxes are collapsible, they can be folded up completely flat into a small size for easy storage in a drawer, closet, car or luggage. With its well-constructed design and cardboard support, the organizer stays firm and upright itself. The sturdy side design makes these storage bins stackable, allowing you to take full advantage of your space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KFl+kwK7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIHAP","source_asin":"B09GVJ46SZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GVJ46SZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GVJ46SZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
