window.products.push({"id":797393,"name":"Studio Oh! Coasters, 12 Count, Retro Cafe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yQRlebCmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Really, do any of us ever have enough coasters? Put an end once and for all to offering guests magazines or flimsy cocktail napkins to keep their beverages from making a lasting impression on your furniture! Studio Oh!’s paper coasters are fun, colorful and so much less in-your-face than those formal marble or glass coasters your grandmother offered up. The coasters are made from heavyweight FSC-certified cardstock printed with food-safe soy based ink, and they’re available in 13 unique designs that happily mix and match with Studio Oh!’s paper placemats; each package of 12 coasters includes four different companionable designs. And, best of all, if gently used the coasters are even reusable. The passionate and creative designers at Studio Oh! believe that products should not only be relevant to the needs of today’s consumers but also should be environmentally responsible, infused with energy, elevated design, richly-saturated colors and fine craftsmanship. From beautiful calendars loaded with super functional planning features, stationery and journals that move and inspire to home and kitchen accessories with plain-old-amazing designs, Studio Oh! invites you to explore their extraordinary products available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yQRlebCmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Studio Oh!","source_asin":"B005IZOH0G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005IZOH0G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005IZOH0G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":797394,"name":"Kobo Candles Kobo Soy Candle, Vetiver and Shaved Vanilla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31M-sKVrp6L._AC_.jpg","description":"KOBO pure soy candles were created by and for those passionate about memorable scents, and the fresh look of the KOBO packaging is a gift so beautiful it need not be wrapped. KOBO was created in 2006 by Junko Kobori. Originally from Kumamoto in southern Japan, she and her husband spent many years traveling the world before settling in Saratoga Springs, NY. Junko was always struck by the scent of each place, and how absent those fragrances were when a photo of a location is viewed. Yet later, while reminiscing on her travels, the aroma was still very present to her memory. She came to realize that fragrance is one of the key elements to bringing any environment to life, and it is the most often overlooked. Junko began creating scents for her own home that would be as equally memorable to her family and guests as the paintings on the walls, or flavors of the food served. From this the KOBO range was born. Kobo candles are made of domestically grown sustainable soybeans. This creates the cleanest burning medium and excellent level of fragrance yield. Cotton wicks provide a pure and clean flame. Kobo candles are not only created using environmentally friendly materials but they do not pollute the home either. The Kobo scents are achieved using the finest boutique fragrance houses in the US. Each candle is then made to specific standards that maximize the fragrance yield to the individual scent to create a room-filling yet not overpowering aroma.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31M-sKVrp6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOBO","source_asin":"B003ATNOBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003ATNOBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003ATNOBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
