window.products.push({"id":797820,"name":"OVENTE 2 in 1 Latte Drink Maker with French Press 34 Ounce Coffee and Tea Maker, and Electric Portable Handheld Milk Frother","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PvHuYA18L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Be your own barista – make your favorite coffee or tea at home! Make your coffee brewing safe and effortless with this heat-resistant borosilicate glass carafe with a high-quality stainless steel outer cover and handle. Perfect for both professional baristas and novice coffee lovers.  More hands-on than using a regular coffee pot or coffee machine, this manual brewing method is worth the extra few minutes of your time. Paper filters used with traditional coffee pots absorb the bold, complex flavors found in your coffee grounds. Whereas the 4-level plunging system in this coffee press uses a stainless steel mesh filter that allows natural oils and fine particles of grounds to pass through into your cup.  The result is a bold, full-bodied, richly aromatic brew with little to no wastage. For additional flavor enhancement, add a small amount of hot water to dampen your ground coffee and allow it to bloom for 30 seconds before completely filling the carafe. Through a Froth-full Day Gone are the days when your coffee lacks pizzazz! With the Ovente Electric Stainless Steel Milk Frother , sitting with a cup of coffee will never be the same again. Enjoy extra froth with your coffee at any time of the day; it’s amazing how a thick layer of bubbles sitting atop your coffee can brighten your morning, to make those rainy days brighter. No need to worry about unnecessary wires hooked to your electric milk frother, because this little gem only needs 2 AAA batteries to whisk up a bubbly beverage. And it’s super simple to use; with its one-hand operation, all you need is a push of a button to make your coffee a dream of milky, thick froth. The design is sleek and sophisticated, and easily complements any kitchen. The smooth metal chrome finish makes it a classic piece with a luxurious flare. Unlike other electric milk frothers, this one is lean and easy to store, because we believe in maximizing your space. But then again, there’s more to it than just sprucing up your coffee with a dose of thick, creamy milk. It’s about the small details that remind us of better days. Choose Ovente, because we understand that those minute details remind us of better days that last a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PvHuYA18L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVENTE","source_asin":"B0B72F3S47","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B72F3S47","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B72F3S47","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":797821,"name":"Fishing Boats On The Beach by Vincent van Gogh, 24x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OruoDnn5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features fishing boats on a beach. Vincent van Gogh was a Dutch post-Impressionist painter whose work, notable for its rough beauty, emotional honesty and bold color, had a far-reaching influence on 20th-century art. He sold only one painting during his lifetime, and was little known to the art world at the time of his death, but his fame grew rapidly thereafter. His influence on Expressionism, Fauvism and early abstraction was enormous, and it can be seen in many of his works. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OruoDnn5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D0ZA1SI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D0ZA1SI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D0ZA1SI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
