window.products.push({"id":797894,"name":"Laresar Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 33Kpa/400W Stick Vacuum Cleaner, Handheld Vacuum, Stepless Speed Regulation & LED Screen, Headlights, Up to 55Mins, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v84qq6fBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LED Display With an oversized smart display, Laresar vacuums provide real-time feedback on working status, including battery level, suction performance, brush stuck alerts, and full dust alerts. Humanized design to serve you better than traditional vacuum cleaners. Stepless Speed Adjustment & Dust Sensing Forget those dull old vacuum cleaners with only one mode, the Laresar cordless vacuum cleaner is not only equipped with a powerful 400W motor, but also the infinitely adjustable mechanical knob upgraded in 2022 can provide any suction in the range of 8-33KPA. What mode for what surface? You decide. Don't want to manually adjust the speed? No problem, just turn on the vacuum and the Dust Sensing Mode will help you with all kinds of stubborn stains. 55 Mins Running Time The Elite 5 vacuum cleaner is equipped with a seven-cell 2500mAh battery. Up to 55 minutes of run time, enough for a thorough cleaning on a 2,000-square-foot home. Built-in 7-stage filtration system can remove up to 99.99% of tiny dust particles as small as 0.1 microns, keeping indoor air fresh. Carpet Deep Cleaning Thanks to the 2-in-1 upgraded rollers, this cordless vacuum cleaner easily handles multiple surfaces, including hardwood floors, low-pile and medium-pile carpets. The V-shaped roller brush gathers the hair easily and no more troublesome hair tangles. The floor brush can absorb the dust at the cracks of the wall, rotate at any angle, and clean without dead ends. Easy to Clean & Store The dust cup can be emptied with a single touch, no hands-on effort required to remove the dust cup. The vacuum cleaner and accessories will be neatly placed directly on the wall, taking up almost no space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v84qq6fBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laresar","source_asin":"B0BNVKRKH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNVKRKH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNVKRKH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
