window.products.push({"id":797957,"name":"BHeadCat Toothbrush Holder Wall Mounted with Auto Toothpaste Dispenser Squeezer Kit, 8 Brush Slots with Cover 4 Magnetic Cups 1 Cosmetic Organizer Dra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RjZeoBXBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❤ AUTOMATIC TOOTHPASTE DISPENSER: The toothbrush organizer comes with an auto toothpaste squeezer, which squeezes out perfect amount of toothpaste each time, preventing waste of toothpaste. ❤ HIGH QUALITY & ENVIRONMENT FRIENDLY: The Wall mounted toothbrush holder's made of high standard ABS material, sleek outlook, no smell, toxic free. We stand behind the quality of our products and high level customer services. ❤ ALL-IN-ONE SPACE SAVING STORAGE TROY: Toothbrush holder accommodates 4 cups for family use with 8 toothbrushes. Can place toothpaste, Shaver, facial cleaner and cosmetic on top, like your cell phone. Moreover, an organizer drawer is designed to storage cosmetic accessories. The whole collection is for multi-functional storage usages. ❤ UPSIDE-DOWN CUP DESIGN: Upside-down cup design for fast water draining. The cups are securely attached to the holder, never falling down and easy to pick up. 8 brush slots for Quickly drain, effectively keep toothbrushes dry and clean, safer and healthier. The toothbrush cover keeps dust away. ❤ EASY NO-DRILL INSTALLATION: No need to drill holes on wall. Wipe the smooth surface with wet cloth and make it dry thoroughly. Apply the traceless stickers and wait 12 hours before hanging the toothbrush holder. The Toothpaste Dispenser Squeezer Kit makes your bathroom in order and organized. Please be noted that the adhesive sticker only work on surface like wall on tiles, mirror and smooth wooden. Painted walls are not supported. ❤ Please put the toothbrush holder on the sticker after at least 12 hours to avoid falling down. Fail to follow the wall types may result in falling off from the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RjZeoBXBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BHeadCat","source_asin":"B08CZWG5FH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZWG5FH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZWG5FH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":797958,"name":"Double Walled Coffee or Tea Mugs, Perfect Espresso Cappuccino Cups or Latte Glasses, Thermo Insulated Premium Quality Borosilicate Glass, Set of 2 (16","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vCQvSYfdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT GLASSES FOR HOT OR COLD DRINKS: Enjoy your cup of hot coffee, espresso, cappuccino, tea or iced coffee, cold brew, iced tea or juice longer! Our double walled glasses maintain the temperature of your beverage, while the outside stays comfortable to the touch! CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Do NOT use in microwave or oven. Heat beverages separately, then transfer to double walled cup. Handle with care, similar to how you would handle wine glasses. PERFECT LARGE SIZE: Set of 2, 16 ounce (480 ml) large mugs with handle, in a premium design gift package! PREMIUM QUALITY DOUBLE WALLED: Our mugs are hand blown from durable borosilicate glass, allowing them to be thinner, lighter, capable of withstanding thermal shock, scratch, and break resistant. Dishwasher safe, but separate from other dishes to avoid potential impact. Add ice after the liquid and avoid the use of automatic ice dispensers. BEAUTIFUL MODERN DESIGN: Enhance your kitchen with our beautiful double walled coffee or tea glasses! The original design creates the optical illusion that your drink is floating in the air, and is sure to attract the compliments of your family and guests. Our design is both functional and beautiful, and will help you enjoy your favorite beverages a lot longer, whether is a cup of cappuccino in the morning, or a glass of wine or tea in the evening. Dishwasher safe! PERFECT GIFT OR KITCHEN ADDITION: This beautiful Set of 2 coffee or tea glasses comes in a premium design package, and makes a GREAT GIFT for occasions like housewarming, birthday, anniversary, Valentine’s Day, Mother’s Day, Christmas or New Year. Buy a set for your kitchen as well, so you can savor your favorite beverage longer and enjoy your day. Inside the beautiful package, the glasses are packaged in polystyrene foam, so you can be sure they will arrive safely when your order! 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: As a small family company, we care deeply about our customers and our top priority is to make you happy! If for any reason you are not fully satisfied, CONTACT US and we will do everything to help. All our products are covered by the HomeKitchenStar 90 Days Manufacturer Warranty, which customers can extend to 1 FULL YEAR by registering their product after purchase. CLICK with confidence on the “ADD TO CART” button above!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vCQvSYfdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeKitchenStar","source_asin":"B076K29ZSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-797958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076K29ZSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076K29ZSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
